  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Mangrove World Bank via Indonesian Ocean MDTF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support Indonesia&#x2019;s readiness to access blue carbon finance.

The Danish support will complement Indonesia Mangroves for Coastal Resilience Project (M4CR), consisting an IBRD loan of US$ 400 mio to rehabilitate and promote sustainable mangrove landscape management and to improve livelihood opportunities for mangrove communities, and a grant of US$ 15 mio. including from this Danish grant, which will strengthen policy and institutions for mangrove management. The Danish support contributes to Subcomponent 1.4 &#x201c;Facilitating Payments for Blue Carbon&#x201d; of the M4CR, supporting to Indonesia&#x2019;s readiness to access blue carbon finance, which could contribute significantly to its NDCs and other emission reduction goals.</narrative>
  </description>
